Caskaydia Cove Nerd Font

Caskaydia Cove is a patched version of Cascadia Code by Microsoft,
distributed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.

Cascadia Code is (c) Microsoft Corporation and is released under the
SIL Open Font License 1.1: https://scripts.sil.org/OFL

